1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,379
After our first trip, Mira invited me to a camp in Oceania.

2
00:00:04,329 --> 00:00:08,715
On a globe, she showed me the equator, a hemisphere and each pole.

3
00:00:08,715 --> 00:00:11,159
Earth turns around its axis.

4
00:00:11,159 --> 00:00:16,488
Pictures of Arctic ice and an Antarctic station helped us understand the polar regions.

5
00:00:16,488 --> 00:00:22,409
Our route crossed the Atlantic and the Pacific Ocean; another photograph showed the Mediterranean Sea.

6
00:00:22,409 --> 00:00:25,409
Every place has its own story,’ she said.

7
00:00:25,409 --> 00:00:29,034
I remembered the longitude and latitude from our first lesson.

8
00:00:29,034 --> 00:00:32,624
This time, we would help a village find its missing water.

